<title>NORWAY: Statoil Q1 profits up.</title>
<headline>Statoil Q1 profits up.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31:</p>
<p>			    (in billion crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating revenues	 30.2    vs	 24.3</p>
<p> Operating result	    5.2    vs	  4.0</p>
<p> After-tax profit	    1.4    vs	  1.2</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full name of state-owned Norwegian oil and gas company Statoil is Den norske stats oljeselskap AS. It attributed the increase to higher oil prices.</p>
<p>--Rolf Soderlind, Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
